# 50. Important Concepts to Remember

```text
User
    ↓
UID
    ↓
Primary Group
    ↓
Secondary Groups
    ↓
Permissions
    ↓
Access Control
```

The basic relationship is:

```text
User → Group → Permissions → Resources
```

For example:

```text
Rahul
  ↓
Developers
  ↓
Read/Write access
  ↓
/projects
```

